      "level": 1,
      "content": "More on src Attribute"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here's the code from the last example:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<img src=\"tiger.png\">"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This code works only if the image and the HTML file, where we write the code, are in the same directory."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Suppose the image was in an animal subdirectory, which was inside the same directory as the HTML page like this:"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "An image showing the hierarchy of subdirectory",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "To embed this image, we would have to use this code:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<img src=\"animal/tiger.png\">"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
    },
